---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout lang="en" title="Terms of Service | BrewMind" description="Terms of service for the BrewMind app and website.">
  <Header />
  <main class="pt-28 pb-20 px-6">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose">
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>

      <h2>1. Scope</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms of Service (&ldquo;Terms&rdquo;) govern your use of the BrewMind mobile
        application (&ldquo;App&rdquo;) and the BrewMind website at
        <a href="https://brewmind.app">brewmind.app</a> (&ldquo;Website&rdquo;), both operated
        by Tegrovio, Dominik Palzer, Sterntalerweg 65, 40235 D&uuml;sseldorf, Germany
        (&ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo;, &ldquo;our&rdquo;).
      </p>
      <p>
        By installing the App or using the Website you agree to these Terms. If you do not
        agree, please do not use the App or Website.
      </p>

      <h2>2. No account, no server</h2>
      <p>
        The App requires no user account and no registration. It stores your data locally on
        your device and does not transmit it to us. Accordingly, there is no login to protect,
        no server-side profile, and nothing for us to restore if your device is lost. Backing
        up your device is your responsibility.
      </p>
      <p>
        The App can copy a single shot or a selection from your history to the clipboard as
