        <li>A build may expire or be replaced; TestFlight builds have a limited lifetime set by Apple.</li>
        <li>Beta access is provided free of charge and may be discontinued, or the App may move to a paid model later.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Distribution through TestFlight is additionally subject to Apple's own terms for that
        service.
      </p>

      <h2>4. No warranty</h2>
      <p>
        The App and Website are provided <strong>&ldquo;as is&rdquo; and &ldquo;as
