        phone or an uninstall removes your records permanently.
      </p>
      <p>
        The App records and displays what you measured. It does not give brewing advice, and
        nothing it shows is a recommendation you should follow without your own judgement.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Ending use</h2>
      <p>
        You may stop using the App at any time by uninstalling it, which removes its local
        data. There is no account to close.
      </p>

